WEBVTT

00:09:28.974 --> 00:09:32.339
And the government came out
with the same type of programs

00:09:32.363 --> 00:09:33.974
that we're having now.

00:09:33.998 --> 00:09:36.164
Yes, OK, same thing.

00:09:36.188 --> 00:09:38.093
Interest rates hit zero.

00:09:38.117 --> 00:09:40.458
Same thing, OK, same dynamics.

00:09:40.863 --> 00:09:42.322
And then, there is --

00:09:42.346 --> 00:09:46.649
That money causes an expansion
from that point.

00:09:46.673 --> 00:09:49.276
How long does it take for the stock market

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:51.760
to exceed its highs?

00:09:51.784 --> 00:09:56.084
Or how long does it take for the economy
to exceed its former highs?

00:09:56.402 --> 00:09:57.552
A long time.

00:09:57.863 --> 00:09:59.014
OK.

00:09:59.038 --> 00:10:00.585
Do I think that's what we're in?